米澎程探索版的日常。<br>最近家事多，更新慢了些。<br>忙里偷闲的松弛感，基本都是这台探索版给的。<br>支桌能办公，放倒能歇着，关上门就是专属的小空间。<br>代步之外，还能装下所有零碎的情绪，这大概就是它最棒的地方。<br>#小米澎程##小米澎程[超话]##小米汽车##小米汽车[超话]# @雷军  ​​​</p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5sx9x66j32dc35snpe.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t0lsgxj328h2z97wi.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t3k623j32dc35shdu.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t6dylzj32dc35s7wi.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5stkz3yj328n2zk1ky.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t9xy4mj32dc35s1kz.jpg\"></p>","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5sx9x66j32dc35snpe.jpg","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5sx9x66j32dc35snpe.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t0lsgxj328h2z97wi.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t3k623j32dc35shdu.jpg","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t6dylzj32dc35